      barrier: { zh: "被控对象会自己长大、变异且个体各异：生长带来时变延迟，异质性与分子噪声让经典整定失效；把外部计算机的反馈真正内化成细胞自带的分子控制器，仍是这条线最大的鸿沟。", en: "The plant grows, mutates, and differs cell to cell: growth introduces time-varying delay, while heterogeneity and molecular noise defeat classical tuning. Internalizing the external computer's feedback into an in vivo biomolecular controller remains the field's widest gap." },
