    depth: {
      overview: { zh: "内模原理说：只有含积分环的控制器才能对持续扰动实现鲁棒完美适应。抗量积分反馈用两种分子的隔离与湮灭，在活细胞里把跟踪误差的积分算出来。2023 年内含肽介导的积分反馈给出可实装框架，2024 年 Zand、Gupta 与 Khammash 用级联抗量积分器凑齐生物版 PID，2025 年再以前馈环压住瞬态过冲。", en: "The internal model principle says only a controller containing an integrator achieves robust perfect adaptation against sustained disturbance. Antithetic integral feedback computes that integral of tracking error inside a living cell through the sequestration and annihilation of two species. An intein-mediated integral-feedback framework made it implementable in 2023; in 2024 Zand, Gupta and Khammash cascaded antithetic integrators into a biological PID; in 2025 a feed-forward loop was added to damp transient overshoot." },
      whyMatters: { zh: "控制器长在细胞里，意味着离开显微镜、进入体内之后设定点依然成立——这是活体疗法与代谢产线'自动驾驶'的前提。代价是控制器要和被控回路抢同一份转录翻译预算。", en: "A controller that lives inside the cell keeps its setpoint away from the microscope and inside a body — the precondition for autopilot in living therapeutics and metabolic production lines. The cost is that it competes with the controlled circuit for the same transcription-translation budget." },
      ifAnswered: { zh: "可编程的稳态调节器能被写进细胞与菌群，把失稳的生理稳态拉回设定点，或让代谢产线自己维持产率，而不需要外部计算机始终留在环内。", en: "Programmable homeostatic regulators can be written into cells and consortia — pulling destabilized physiological homeostasis back to setpoint, or letting a metabolic production line hold its own yield, with no external computer required to stay in the loop." },
      approaches: [
        { zh: "用内含肽介导的分子隔离实现积分环，把抗量控制器做成可在不同底盘间移植的遗传模块。", en: "Realize the integrator through intein-mediated molecular sequestration, turning the antithetic controller into a genetic module portable across chassis." },
        { zh: "级联抗量积分器凑出比例—积分—微分三项，以更大裕度换取对参数漂移的鲁棒稳定。", en: "Cascade antithetic integrators to assemble proportional, integral and derivative action, buying robust stability against parameter drift with added margin." },
        { zh: "用前馈环整形瞬态以压过冲，并以资源竞争模型量化控制器对宿主生长速率的占用。", en: "Shape the transient with a feed-forward loop to suppress overshoot, and quantify the controller's claim on host growth rate with a resource-competition model." },
      ],
      barrier: { zh: "控制器与被控回路共用同一份转录翻译资源，这种竞争本身就是一条未被设计的反馈通路并注入耦合噪声；瞬态过冲、代谢负担与鲁棒性至今无法同时满足。", en: "Controller and controlled circuit draw on the same transcription-translation pool, and that competition is itself an undesigned feedback path injecting coupling noise. Transient overshoot, metabolic burden, and robustness still cannot be satisfied at once." },
      subQuestions: [
        { zh: "抗量对的隔离速率要多快，才能在分子数低到有明显随机涨落时仍逼近理想积分？", en: "How fast must the antithetic pair's sequestration be for the motif to approximate an ideal integrator when molecule counts are low enough to fluctuate stochastically?" },
        { zh: "资源竞争引入的隐式反馈，能否被写进设计方程，而不是事后当作外部扰动去补偿？", en: "Can the implicit feedback introduced by resource competition be written into the design equations, rather than compensated afterwards as an external disturbance?" },
        { zh: "同一控制器移植到不同底盘或菌群成员时，设定点跟踪精度会按什么规律退化？", en: "When the same controller is ported to a different chassis or consortium member, by what law does setpoint-tracking accuracy degrade?" },
      ],
    },
