    qfocus: { zh: "一张常温读出的 Cas12/Cas13 试纸，能否在抑制物密布的环境样本里从「检出有无」走到可信定量与多目标并行？", en: "Can a room-temperature Cas12/Cas13 strip move from presence-absence calls to trustworthy quantification and multiplexing in environmental samples dense with inhibitors?" },
