    slug: "transcranial-acoustoelectric-brain-imaging-tabi",
    title: { zh: "经颅声电脑成像（tABI）", en: "Transcranial Acoustoelectric Brain Imaging (tABI)" },
    qfocus: { zh: "在跨颅骨后极小的声电耦合系数下，超声焦点能否把清醒人体的神经电流标记成可测的电流密度图？", en: "Given how small the acoustoelectric coupling coefficient becomes across the skull, can an ultrasound focus tag neural current in an awake human into a measurable current-density map?" },
