    qfocus: { zh: "在同一张切片上共测染色质可及性与 mRNA 时，分辨率、覆盖度与通量的三方取舍能被推到哪一步？", en: "When co-profiling chromatin accessibility and mRNA on one section, how far can the three-way trade-off among resolution, coverage and throughput be pushed?" },
