    title: { zh: "原位空间翻译组学：在组织里给「正在被翻译的 mRNA」拍照", en: "In Situ Spatial Translatomics: Imaging the mRNA Being Translated, In Tissue" },
    qfocus: { zh: "在完整组织里成像「正在被翻译的 mRNA」，如何把核糖体结合与偶然共定位可靠地分开？", en: "When imaging actively translated mRNA in intact tissue, how can genuine ribosome binding be reliably separated from incidental colocalization?" },
