    qfocus: { zh: "小鼠里持续 550 天的表观沉默，能否在人肝细胞的更新与炎症环境下不被洗脱？", en: "Can epigenetic silencing that held for 550 days in mice survive human hepatocyte turnover and inflammation without being washed out?" },
